        "summary": "Rhombus-shaped Dy4 cluster 1 shows slow magnetic relaxation/SMM behavior under zero dc field. Room-temperature χMT is close to four free DyIII ions and decreases on cooling, consistent with Stark depopulation and possible antiferromagnetic Dy···Dy interactions. Arrhenius analysis of ac peaks gives ΔE/kB = 83.38 K and τ0 = 1.51×10−7 s; Cole–Cole α = 0.26–0.59 indicates a relatively wide distribution of relaxation times.",
